  Text: "She does not partake in conversation.\n\n\"There were two at 54\" is all
    that she says. \n\nWhatever happened left her in a deep shell-shock state. \n\nShe
    clearly knows something, there's just no way of getting anything else out of
    her as she is."
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?

    The report is probably
    on your desk or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
